1,-0.01926575,-0.02460445,0.06940215,0.11557994,-0.06416027,0.07615485,-0.05898045,-0.04738454,0.01242338,0.19531588,-0.06550253,0.03283422,0.00325832,-0.02144096,-0.02513258,0.02273524,0.00468013,0.0520663,-0.01221463,0.12898102,-0.00498685,-0.01968995,0.08552231,0.00363662,-0.01525264,0.00003111,-0.00600245,0.07476943,-0.02812946,-0.02274957,-0.06610741,0.0696452,-0.01980909,0.00772764,-0.04554715,-0.06877332,0.01236401,0.00756312,-0.01661355,-0.03824166,0.00341827,0.04102644,0.03855541,-0.05261704,0.00330366,-0.05063967,-0.00213854,0.04757941,-0.05424085,-0.00293977,0.08427807,0.0116819],"last_embed":{"hash":"gvluhk","tokens":425}}},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"gvluhk","at":1779498219056},"key":"- API Reference · Hugging Face.md##Other tasks[Audio Classification](https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/audio-classification)","lines":[37,129],"size":3181,"outlinks":[{"title":"Audio Classification","target":"https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/audio-classification","line":1},{"title":"\n\nAudio classification is the task of assigning a label or class to a given audio.\n\n","target":"https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/audio-classification","line":3},{"title":"\n\nAutomatic Speech Recognition\n\nAutomatic Speech Recognition (ASR), also known as Speech to Text (STT), is the task of transcribing a given audio to text.\n\n","target":"https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/automatic-speech-recognition","line":7},{"title":"\n\nFill Mask\n\nMask filling is the task of predicting the right word (token to be precise) in the middle of a sequence.\n\n","target":"https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/fill-mask","line":13},{"title":"\n\nImage Classification\n\nImage classification is the task of assigning a label or class to an entire image. Images are expected to have only one class for each image.\n\n","target":"https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/image-classification","line":19},{"title":"\n\nImage Segmentation\n\nImage Segmentation divides an image into segments where each pixel in the image is mapped to an object.\n\n","target":"https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/image-segmentation","line":25},{"title":"\n\nImage to Image\n\nImage-to-image is the task of transforming a source image to match the characteristics of a target image or a target image domain.\n\n","target":"https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/image-to-image","line":31},{"title":"\n\nObject Detection\n\nObject Detection models allow users to identify objects of certain defined classes.\n\n","target":"https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/object-detection","line":37},{"title":"\n\nQuestion Answering\n\nQuestion Answering models can retrieve the answer to a question from a given text, which is useful for searching for an answer in a document.\n\n","target":"https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/question-answering","line":43},{"title":"\n\nSummarization\n\nSummarization is the task of producing a shorter version of a document while preserving its important information.\n\n","target":"https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/summarization","line":49},{"title":"\n\nTable Question Answering\n\nTable Question Answering (Table QA) is the answering a question about an information on a given table.\n\n","target":"https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/table-question-answering","line":55},{"title":"\n\nText Classification\n\nText Classification is the task of assigning a label or class to a given text.\n\n","target":"https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/text-classification","line":61},{"title":"\n\nText Generation\n\nGenerate text based on a prompt.\n\n","target":"https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/text-generation","line":67},{"title":"\n\nToken Classification\n\nToken classification is a task in which a label is assigned to some tokens in a text.\n\n","target":"https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/token-classification","line":73},{"title":"\n\nTranslation\n\nTranslation is the task of converting text from one language to another.\n\n","target":"https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/translation","line":79},{"title":"\n\nZero Shot Classification\n\nZero shot classification is the task to classify text without specific training for the task.\n\n","target":"https://huggingface.co/docs/inference-providers/tasks/zero-shot-classification","line":85},{"title":"Update on GitHub","target":"https://github.com/huggingface/hub-docs/blob/main/docs/inference-providers/tasks/index.md","line":93}],"class_name":"SmartBlock","last_embed":{"hash":"gvluhk","at":1779498219056}},
